{{Quote|Stay low all the way to Farside Sea. The moment you get over the water, you climb. Straight home, full pump, hand throttle, no comms. All in. You understand?|Cassian Andor giving instructions to Jezzi|<ref name="Rix Road">{{Andor|Rix Road (episode)}}</ref>}}
'''Farside Sea''' was an [[ocean]] on<ref name="Rix Road" /> the [[planet]]<ref name="Nobody's Listening!">{{Andor|Nobody's Listening!}}</ref> [[Ferrix]].<ref name="Rix Road" /> In [[5 BBY]],<ref name="Date">{{AndorDate|112}}</ref> the Ferrixians [[Brasso]], [[Bix Caleen]], [[Jezzi]], and [[Wilmon Paak]] and the [[B2 groundmech]] [[salvage assist unit]] [[B2EMO]] sought to escape Ferrix as they were on the run from [[Galactic Empire|Imperial]] [[Ferrix garrison|authorities]] due to their involvement in the [[Ferrix Riot|Rix Road riot]]. Their fellow Ferrixian fugitive [[Cassian Jeron Andor|Cassian Andor]] instructed Jezzi to [[pilot]] their [[Breon HOY-39 Dayvan]] [[Starship|ship]] low until they got to Farside Sea and then ascend on the way to [[Gangi Moon]], where they hoped to hide.<ref name="Rix Road" />

==Behind the scenes==
Farside Sea was mentioned in "[[Rix Road (episode)|Rix Road]]," the twelfth episode of the [[Andor Season 1|first season]] of the [[Disney+]] television series ''[[Star Wars: Andor]]'',<ref name="Rix Road" /> which aired on [[November 23]], [[2022]].<ref name="Release dates">{{Twitter|starwars|status/1557442379975573504|[[Star Wars]]|date=2022-8-10|quote=This is what revolution looks like. Watch #Andor, a Star Wars Original Series, streaming only on @DisneyPlus September 21.|archivedate=20220810191942}}</ref>

